Package: reCYCLing
Type: Package
Title: Repeat Element Cyclical Evolutionary Simulations in Genomes
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Grey Monroe [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Grey Monroe <greymonroe@gmail.com>
Description: Simulates the evolution of tandem repeat arrays (e.g., satellite
    DNA-like monomers) through local duplication, distal duplication, chunk
    deletion, and per-base mutation. Provides visualization tools for
    repeat fingerprints, monomer diversity, and array composition.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
